I've been reading a lot about possible solutions to polypile abuses here 
  in r.g.h, and I believe that everyone is overlooking an easy solution.
Make the WoP affect only the top object in a pile.
With a range of 3-6 squares or so polypiling (er. polylining?) would still
  be possible and profitable, but with not nearly the abuse from it as
  when someone polymorphs hundreds of objects in a pile.
Also, since polypile abuses would be cut down, WoP, WoW, and magic lamps
  should again have a chance (small) of being made.


